# The bow canted for a quick shot (docs/manual-aim.md, stage 3): the mouse wheel down while the bow is up
# cants it, up straightens it. The bow turns round the arrow, its top limb toward the drawing hand, the
# fingers on the string with it; drawn faster, settles faster after a turn, looser. Close up from the side,
# in front, behind and from the game's camera; aimed up and down; then the hits upright and canted at a
# farmer 8 and 25 m off (bd_cant, m_cant; the hits in the log)
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_01
turn 225
wait 500
open 5000
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 200
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1000 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
stats str 60 dex 60 bow 60
tap bow
wait 1500
cam follow 220 150 90             # the left side: the arrow's line across the frame
cam look 145
wait 300

rec upright_side
volley 1 600
stop

# canted while the bow is up: it turns in, the next shots canted
rec cant_side
press action
wait 800
wheel -1
wait 1200
release action
wait 1500
volley 1 600
stop

cam follow 170 150 -50            # in front, on the right: the drawing hand
wait 300
rec cant_front
volley 1 600
stop

cam front 230 150                 # as the target sees it: canted, then upright
wait 300
rec cant_target
volley 1 600
wheel 1
wait 800
volley 1 600
wheel -1
wait 800
stop

cam follow 200 120 200            # behind: the bow's lean
wait 300
rec cant_back
volley 1 600
wheel 1
wait 800
volley 1 600
stop

cam game
wait 300
wheel -1
rec cant_game
volley 2 600
stop

# up and down: the bow canted round the arrow as the body bends
cam follow 220 150 90
wait 300
rec cant_up
aimat ahead 1000 700
volley 1 600
stop
rec cant_down
aimat ahead 1000 -600
volley 1 600
stop

# the hits: upright and canted, close (the head) and far (the body); from behind
cam follow 300 80 165
cam look 150
pin BAU_904_BAUER 800 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER head
wheel 1
wait 600
rec upright8_head
volley 6 300
stop
wheel -1
wait 600
rec cant8_head
volley 6 300
stop
pin BAU_904_BAUER 2500 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
wheel 1
wait 600
rec upright25_body
volley 6 300
stop
wheel -1
wait 600
rec cant25_body
volley 6 300
stop
